/P 684 0 R
/E (Figure 1: The SPARTA testbench is a vertically integrated actuation and sensing assembly that applies controlled axial and torsional loads during subsurface interaction tests. A linear actuator drives penetration force measurement via a load cell, while a planetary gear reduction stage provides torque. The gearbox output is instrumented with a torque sensor, with the SPARTA probe mounted at the tip for simultaneous force and torque measurements.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [42]
>>
